Package: wb-dmx-fixtures
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
         python3-wb-common (>= 2.1.0~~)
Description: DMX fixtures on a Wiren Board controller via a WB-MGU DMX gateway
 Publishes fixtures described by Open Fixture Library profiles as MQTT devices
 with semantic controls (dimmer, colour, pan/tilt, strobe modes) and writes
 the resulting DMX channels to a WB-MGU gateway over Modbus TCP.
